{"seq":1,"slug":"membership-tier-definition-model","title":"等级定义与分层建模：阈值、点数口径与等级树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/tier-state-lifecycle-model/membership-tier-definition-model","wordCount":2824,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"等级定义与分层建模-阈值-点数口径与等级树\">等级定义与分层建模：阈值、点数口径与等级树</h1><p>一个会员在雅加达是 Gold、在柏林是 Silver，两边订单金额都是 5,000 美元却判出两个等级——如果把「Gold」当成写死在代码里的常量，这个 bug 永远修不完。等级定义不是一张 <code>tier_id -&gt; name</code> 查找表，而是三层彼此正交的声明：<strong>等级树</strong>决定有哪些层以及层与层的关系，<strong>达标口径</strong>决定用什么量去量一个会员，<strong>阈值</strong>决定这个量到多少才算达标。本文把这三点拆开建模，它是<a href=\"tier-qualification-recalculation-engine\">资格计算与升降级引擎</a>和<a href=\"tier-expiry-downgrade-reinstatement\">等级到期与降级保护</a>共同的输入契约——那两篇讲「什么时候算、算完怎么落地」，本文讲「算的是什么」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>等级定义的三个组成部分必须分开存放，因为它们的变更频率和影响面完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>变更影响面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等级树</td>\n<td>有几层、谁在谁之上</td>\n<td>极低（数年）</td>\n<td>全量等级编码、权益目录重排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>达标口径</td>\n<td>用哪个量衡量会员</td>\n<td>低（一年）</td>\n<td>进行中的资格计算口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值</td>\n<td>该量的达标线是多少</td>\n<td>高（季度可调）</td>\n<td>单个市场的升降级判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等级有效期</td>\n<td>达标后能维持多久</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>到期与降级任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把三者揉在一张 <code>tier</code> 表里是最常见的起点，也是最贵的错误：一旦运营要把东南亚的 Gold 门槛从 5,000 调到 3,000，diff 里会同时出现「等级名称的元数据」和「一条影响百万会员升降级的业务规则」，review 无法判断改动是否安全。等级判定因此应形式化为谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>qualify</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{qualify}(u,t,w) = q(u,w) \\ge \\theta_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qualify</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（会员 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>、评定窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>、等级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>），整棵等级树就是这组谓词加上它们之间的偏序关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;事件流&lt;br/&gt;订单/退款/评价&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;口径归集&lt;br/&gt;映射成达标量 q&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;等级树求值&lt;br/&gt;找最深满足节点&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;q 达阈值?&quot;}&#10;  D -- 否 --&gt; E[&quot;基线等级 Member&quot;]&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; F[&quot;命中节点集合&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;取偏序最上位节点&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;写入等级状态&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"事件流&lt;br/&gt;订单/退款/评价\"] --&gt; B[\"口径归集&lt;br/&gt;映射成达标量 q\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"等级树求值&lt;br/&gt;找最深满足节点\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"q 达阈值?\"}\n  D -- 否 --&gt; E[\"基线等级 Member\"]\n  D -- 是 --&gt; F[\"命中节点集合\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"取偏序最上位节点\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"写入等级状态\"]</pre><p>关键设计是：<strong>等级树求值只产出「判定结果」，不产出任何副作用</strong>。写入等级状态、发通知、发放权益都在判定之后的独立阶段完成。这个边界让资格计算可被反复重算（比如规则变更后的回溯），而不重复触发发奖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级树-从线性阶梯到带分支的分层结构\">等级树：从线性阶梯到带分支的分层结构</h2><p>大多数教程把等级画成一条阶梯：Member → Silver → Gold → Platinum。真实业务几乎从来不是线性的。线性阶梯假设等级<strong>全序</strong>且<strong>单维度</strong>，航空常旅客入门段大致满足——AAdvantage 用单一指标 Loyalty Points 划出 Gold 40,000、Platinum 75,000、Platinum Pro 125,000、Executive Platinum 200,000 四档，档间是纯粹的数值包含关系（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AAdvantage\">AAdvantage</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"何时必须引入分支\">何时必须引入分支</h3><p>三种情况会让线性阶梯失效。第一，<strong>连接词不是「或」而是「与」</strong>：汉莎 Miles &amp; More 的 Frequent Traveller 要求同时满足 650 分与 325 个资格分，Senator 要求 2,000 分与 1,000 个资格分（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miles_%26_More\">Miles &amp; More</a>），阈值是合取式时节点就是多条件谓词。第二，<strong>存在跨维度的第二重门槛</strong>：万豪 Bonvoy 的 Ambassador 要求在 100 晚之外叠加 23,000 美元年度合格消费，而 Silver 到 Titanium 只需 10/25/50/75 晚（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marriott_Bonvoy\">Marriott Bonvoy</a>），这是给最高层加了正交条件。第三，<strong>存在平行子体系</strong>：等级会被翻译成另一体系的等级（如映射到 oneworld 的 Ruby/Sapphire/Emerald），每个节点因此必须保留<strong>对外映射字段</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节点与边必须显式建模\">节点与边必须显式建模</h3><p>统一成一张图：节点代表等级状态，边代表偏序关系（<code>parent_code</code>），节点上挂一个<strong>判定谓词</strong>（标量阈值或合取式）。求值时从根向叶遍历，返回满足谓词的最深节点；命中多个不可比节点时用 <code>priority</code> 打破平局。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构形态</th>\n<th>判定谓词</th>\n<th>典型实例</th>\n<th>建模要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性阶梯</td>\n<td>单标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>AAdvantage 四档</td>\n<td>可用整数数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合取节点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_1 \\ge \\theta_1 \\land q_2 \\ge \\theta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Miles &amp; More FT/Senator</td>\n<td>谓词需可序列化为表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叠加门槛</td>\n<td>主口径 + 副口径均达标</td>\n<td>Bonvoy Ambassador</td>\n<td>副条件只在最高档生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子体系节点</td>\n<td>主树达标 + 映射表</td>\n<td>oneworld Ruby/Sapphire/Emerald</td>\n<td>节点带外部映射字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阈值设计-绝对值-分位与跳变的代价\">阈值设计：绝对值、分位与跳变的代价</h2><p>阈值是运营手里最常被拧的旋钮，但它不是随便一个数字。<strong>绝对值阈值</strong>直接写死金额或次数，例如达美 2026 年的 MQD 门槛为 Silver 5,000 美元、Gold 10,000 美元、Platinum 15,000 美元、Diamond 28,000 美元，且 MQD 每个自然年重置（来源：<a href=\"https://www.delta.com/us/en/skymiles/medallion-program/how-to-qualify\">Delta SkyMiles</a>）。它可预测性最好，会员能精确知道还差多少，但通胀或汇率波动会让达标难度随时间改变。</p>\n<p><strong>分位阈值</strong>把门槛定义成人群的某个分位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_t = Q_{1-p_t}(\\{q(u,w) : u \\in U\\})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span></span></span></span></span>，例如把 Gold 定义为消费额前 10% 的用户。它天然对抗通胀，但会员无法预知目标，且每次评估前要全量算分布——跨境多市场下，分位按市场单独算还是全局算会直接决定各市场的等级占比。工程折中是<strong>用绝对阈值发布、分位阈值监控</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阈值跳变的代价\">阈值跳变的代价</h3><p>两个相邻等级阈值之差决定了「差一点」的损失有多大：设 Gold 与 Platinum 阈值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，会员消费额停在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_P - \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 处时损失的权益价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(\\epsilon) = V_P - V_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即<strong>阈值正下方边际收益是断崖式的</strong>——多花 1 元不产生任何等级收益，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 元却一次性兑换了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_P - V_G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这带来三种副作用：临界会员周期末尾冲刺、阈值附近申诉率升高、「差 100 元掉档」引发的退款撤单（后者反向污染资格计算，正是<a href=\"tier-expiry-downgrade-reinstatement\">追单与退回保护</a>处理的）。缓解手段有三类：平滑的权益阶梯、宽限期、保级挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"点数口径-达标量-可花量与成长值是三种量\">点数口径：达标量、可花量与成长值是三种量</h2><p>「点数」在会员系统里至少指三种东西，混用是等级定义里最隐蔽的缺陷来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>能否花费</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>达标量（qualifying）</td>\n<td>衡量会员够不够格</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>MQD、定级航段、合格消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可花量（redeemable）</td>\n<td>能用来抵扣/兑换</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>里程、积分、星星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成长值（growth）</td>\n<td>单调累积的身份量</td>\n<td>否，但可清零</td>\n<td>成长值、经验值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>达美的做法最能说明为何必须分离：MQD 由飞行与联名卡消费产生，但 MQD 本身不能花，只是资格衡量，且每个日历年重置（来源同上）。假如把两者合并成一个 <code>points</code> 字段，立刻出现三个无法回答的问题：花掉的积分要不要从等级资格里扣回去？积分过期是否应该导致掉级？用积分抵扣的订单还算不算合格消费？</p>\n<p>分离的收益明确：<strong>达标量只增不减（或周期结束时整体清零），可花量随花费减少</strong>，这条性质让资格计算变成单调问题。二者唯一的合法耦合点是换算率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>qualifying</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{qualifying}} = \\sum_{i} \\alpha_i x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">qualifying</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类事件的计数或金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是换算系数（如「每消费 1 元记 1 个 MQD」，Delta 的 MQD Boost 即「每 20 元联名卡消费记 1 个 MQD」）。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 放进配置而非代码，就得到本文开头那个「同一美元在不同市场判出不同等级」问题的解药：每个市场一份 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，等级树本身共享。多口径达标时，常见错误是把不同量纲的指标直接加权成一个数——「消费额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> + 登录次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>」看起来平衡，实际上系数成了隐藏的策略决定；正确做法是<strong>保留多个独立维度，在谓词层面做合取</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级定义的建模与版本化\">等级定义的建模与版本化</h2><p>把三层结构落成表结构，最小模型只需三张表加一张版本指针。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 方案: 按市场分叉, 每行是不可变版本快照&#10;tier_scheme(scheme_id PK, market, scheme_ver, status, effective_at, UNIQUE(market, scheme_ver))&#10;-- 等级节点: 偏序(parent_code) + 平局打破(priority) + 对外映射(external_map)&#10;tier_node(node_id PK, scheme_id FK, code, parent_code, priority, external_map)&#10;-- 判定条件: 同一节点多行即合取&#10;tier_criteria(criteria_id PK, node_id FK, metric, operator, threshold NUMERIC(18,4), window_key)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 方案: 按市场分叉, 每行是不可变版本快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tier_scheme(scheme_id PK, market, scheme_ver, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, effective_at, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(market, scheme_ver))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 等级节点: 偏序(parent_code) + 平局打破(priority) + 对外映射(external_map)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tier_node(node_id PK, scheme_id FK, code, parent_code, priority, external_map)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 判定条件: 同一节点多行即合取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tier_criteria(criteria_id PK, node_id FK, metric, operator, threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), window_key)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三点建模约束值得强调。第一，<strong>编码与名称分离</strong>：<code>code</code> 是稳定标识，界面上的「金卡」只是展示名，绝不参与逻辑判断，否则改一次文案就污染历史数据。第二，<strong>阈值用 <code>NUMERIC</code> 而非浮点</strong>，避免累积比较误差让刚好达标的会员被判为未达标。第三，<strong>方案整体版本化</strong>：会员的当前等级记录它当时依据的 <code>scheme_ver</code>，任何规则调整都不就地改历史。引入版本逼你表态三件事：进行中的周期按哪个版本算（通常锁定周期起始版本，否则同一批人算出两种结果）、已达标但未用完的权益按哪个版本兑付（通常按获得时版本）、降级保护窗口跨版本如何计算（按时间轴分段求值）。运营把 Gold 门槛从 5,000 调到 3,000 时，可选只对新周期生效或回溯重算，回溯的正确做法是让资格计算按指定版本重跑，这是<a href=\"tier-qualification-recalculation-engine\">资格重算引擎</a>的核心议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建模的常见失效模式\">建模的常见失效模式</h2><p><strong>阈值漂移无人察觉。</strong> 分位阈值下人群分布变化会让实际达标比例悄悄偏离设计目标，而阈值是算出来的，没有 diff 提醒你；缓解手段是把各等级人数占比做成持续监控指标。</p>\n<p><strong>口径换算率藏在代码里。</strong> 一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 写死在结算服务里，运营无法自主调参，最后演变成「反正不能改就改阈值吧」，口径与阈值互相污染。</p>\n<p><strong>等级名称当主键。</strong> 用 <code>tier_name</code> 做外键或分支判断，改名即事故，多语言环境下直接崩坏。</p>\n<p><strong>假设等级必然可比。</strong> 引入分支后两节点之间可能没有序关系，任何写死的「降级就是 level - 1」都会失效，必须用 <code>parent_code</code> 而非整数减一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>等级定义拆成三层：<strong>等级树</strong>（结构）、<strong>达标口径</strong>（用什么量）、<strong>阈值</strong>（多少算达标），三者变更频率与影响面不同，不能塞进同一张表。</li>\n<li>等级树从线性阶梯扩展为带分支的偏序图，源于合取条件（Miles &amp; More 双口径）、叠加门槛（Bonvoy Ambassador 消费副条件）与跨体系映射（oneworld）。</li>\n<li>阈值可用绝对值（Delta 2026 MQD 5,000/10,000/15,000/28,000 美元，按年重置）或分位值；常见做法是发布绝对值、监控分位占比。阈值跳变造成断崖式收益，缓解手段是权益阶梯平滑、宽限期与保级挑战。</li>\n<li><strong>达标量、可花量、成长值是三种量</strong>，前两者只应通过显式、可配置、按市场分叉的换算率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 耦合。</li>\n<li>建模约束：编码与名称分离、阈值用定点数、方案整体版本化并锁定周期内版本；失效模式集中在阈值漂移、换算率硬编码、名称当主键与假设等级可比四类。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读懂本文之后，<a href=\"tier-qualification-recalculation-engine\">资格计算与升降级引擎</a>回答「这套定义在什么时刻被求值」，<a href=\"tier-expiry-downgrade-reinstatement\">等级到期与降级保护</a>回答「判定结果如何随时间衰减与被保护」。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"等级定义与分层建模：阈值、点数口径与等级树","id":"等级定义与分层建模-阈值-点数口径与等级树"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"等级树：从线性阶梯到带分支的分层结构","id":"等级树-从线性阶梯到带分支的分层结构"},{"level":3,"text":"何时必须引入分支","id":"何时必须引入分支"},{"level":3,"text":"节点与边必须显式建模","id":"节点与边必须显式建模"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值设计：绝对值、分位与跳变的代价","id":"阈值设计-绝对值-分位与跳变的代价"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值跳变的代价","id":"阈值跳变的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"点数口径：达标量、可花量与成长值是三种量","id":"点数口径-达标量-可花量与成长值是三种量"},{"level":2,"text":"等级定义的建模与版本化","id":"等级定义的建模与版本化"},{"level":2,"text":"建模的常见失效模式","id":"建模的常见失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"等级资格计算与升降级引擎：滚动窗口、评估节奏与软着陆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/tier-state-lifecycle-model/tier-qualification-recalculation-engine"}}